    "title"    : "PbiToolsWatchPS: Extract and save your Power BI Desktop source code with a single click!",
    "category" : "",
    "tags"     : " Power BI, External Tools, PowerShell, Version Control, Git, pbi-tools",
    "url"      : "/2023/03/21/external-tool-PbiToolsWatchPS.html",
